{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg9x8FWcCu5KjaiCdYSCy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed it: `--and` patterns that contain a path separator now get the same error as the primary pattern. I haven't committed anything.\n\n**Changes:**\n- `src/main.rs` (`ensure_search_pattern_is_not_a_path`): the check now runs on the primary pattern and on each `--and` pattern. The error names the first pattern that fails. I only moved the existing logic into a loop: `--full-path` still turns the check off, and on Windows a `\\` is still only flagged when the pattern is an existing directory.\n- `tests/tests.rs`: new test `test_and_pattern_with_forward_slash_is_rejected`. It checks that `fd foo --and one/two` gives the path-separator error, and that `fd --full-path foo --and one/two` still returns results.\n\n**Testing:**\n- The new test failed before the fix with the expected cause (fd gave no error), and it fails again when I undo only the `src/main.rs` change.\n- With the fix, all tests pass: 139 unit tests and 111 integration tests. `cargo fmt` is clean, and `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` on the source code passes.\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets` fails because of `useless_borrows_in_formatting` errors in `tests/tests.rs`. These were already there before my change (18 errors on the unchanged tree), none are in the lines I added, and I left them alone.\n\nThe branch is a detached HEAD. If you want a commit, I'd make it with the subject \"Flag path separators in --and patterns too\"."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":697,"cache_read_input_tokens":41387,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":697,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2a2d8c58-6e51-4076-a620-92c712ed8c52","uuid":"d57293ca-00f7-49b8-bee8-ae8680a788c9","timestamp":"2026-10-18T15:37:38.993Z","request_id":"req_011Cg9x8FJSpToaGyYVX8GsP"}
